TEXT 64 0 Left 3 ;3.3 V Hysteretic Oscillator
TEXT 64 528 Left 2 !.tran 0 15 0
TEXT 64 584 Left 1 !.meas tran t_rise WHEN V(out)=1.65 RISE=1 TD=10\n.meas tran t_next WHEN V(out)=1.65 RISE=2 TD=10\n.meas tran t_fall WHEN V(out)=1.65 FALL=1 TD=10\n.meas tran period PARAM t_next-t_rise\n.meas tran high_time PARAM if(t_fall>t_rise,t_fall-t_rise,t_fall-t_rise+period)\n.meas tran duty_pct PARAM 100*high_time/period
